From 475316c06373fc52910ec9daabf096c06413fba5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew <matthewhale@live.com.au>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:48:39 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 51/59] game.xwa_roll: X-Wing Alliance twist roll

The analog roll axis uses XWA's per-craft ModelDef rollRate (input * rate /
14336, applied twice) scaled by XWA's throttle curve and power steps, XWA's 8%
twist dead zone, and the yaw auto-bank stays on while the twist is deflected.
Craft XWA has no rate for keep X-Wing's own. Game page: Twist Roll.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
