+/* view_target (Z): XvT's threat display. The camera always shows the player's current target, whatever kind
+ * of object it is (craft, warhead or mission object such as a mine or buoy), so the game's own camera focus
+ * stays on the player and flight_camera.c places the view. Other view keys that leave the external view end
+ * it. */
+static int s_targetViewFlag, s_targetViewPreviousExternal;
